    "preamble": "D,Anand vs The State Of A.P. on 18 August, 2020 Author: K. Suresh Reddy Bench: K. Suresh Reddy The Hon'Ble Sri Justice K. Suresh Reddy Criminal Petition No.3213 Of 2020 Order:",
    "facts": "",
    "arguments": "Counsel for the petitioners has placed reliance on the common order dated 18.12.2019 passed by a coordinate Bench of this Court in Criminal Petition Nos.5421 of 2019 and batch, holding that \"tobacco\" does not fall within the definition of \"food\", as specified under Section 3(i)(j) of the Act, therefore, registration of FIR is not permissible.",
